Example schema.graphql files (not included)

The example Functions under examples/functions/ need the Discount Function API
schema (schema.graphql). That file is Shopify's, and the copies published in
Shopify's extensions-templates repository have no stated licence (checked
2026-11-14: no LICENSE file, and a private package.json with no licence field).
So this repository does not include it. Each developer fetches it with the
Shopify CLI. That needs a Shopify login and the client ID of an app in your
own Shopify developer account (examples/shopify.app.toml holds a placeholder):

  cd examples
  shopify app function schema --path functions/tiered-discount-rust --client-id <your app client ID>
  shopify app function schema --path functions/bundle-discount-js --client-id <your app client ID>
